{"id":"amado","lemma":"amado","pos":"adj","rank":1870,"glosses":["beloved"],"ipa":"/aˈmado/","forms":{"feminine":"amada","masculinePlural":"amados","femininePlural":"amadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-amado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Has amado a un hombre alguna vez?","en":"Have you ever loved a man?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770054"},{"text":"Ella es amada por todos.","en":"She is loved by everybody."},{"text":"Todos quieren sentirse amados.","en":"Everyone wants to feel loved."},{"text":"Las mujeres necesitan ser amadas, no comprendidas.","en":"Women are meant to be loved, not to be understood."},{"text":"Nunca me sentí amado.","en":"I never felt loved."}]}